- **`src/buildings/registry.ts`** — registered `market` (`{ wood: 20, stone: 15 }`, `requires: "storehouse"`), widened `BuildingCategory` to include `"trade"`, and mapped `market` to it. (The widened category was required because `BUILDING_CATEGORY` is `Record<BuildingKind, BuildingCategory>`, so the union can't grow without it.)
